  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**DI012 guarded fallback false positive**: `TryAdd*` fallback registrations no longer report as ignored when the earlier `Add*` is guarded by an `if` branch and the fallback executes unconditionally afterward. | **DI012 mutually exclusive duplicate false positive**: `if`/`else` branches that register alternative implementations of the same service no longer report duplicate overrides, because only one branch can run. | **DI012 nested mutually exclusive duplicate false positive**: registrations nested inside one arm of an outer `if`/`else` chain no longer report duplicates against registrations in another outer arm. | **DI012 nested known-true branch regression pin**: nested registrations guarded by known-true conditions now count as covering their outer branch before a later `TryAdd*` fallback.",
